    <briefdescription>
<para>Bimap for multi-file drop separator mode — &quot;space&quot; or &quot;newline&quot;. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Used by nexus.terminal.drop_multifiles. 0 → &quot;space&quot; — join paths with spaces (default) 1 → &quot;newline&quot; — join paths with newlines</para>
<para>Registered in <ref refid="classend_1_1_application" kindref="compound">Application</ref> CONTEXT before <ref refid="classconfig_1_1_model" kindref="compound">config::Model</ref> construction. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
